-overview&family=washingtondc&ft:locale=en-US","line":80},{"title":"Trusted timestamps within the Code Signing framework","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=code-signing-landing&family=washingtondc&ft:locale=en-US","line":84},{"title":"Reusable key for agent-to-agent credential sharing","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=client-access-secret-landing&family=washingtondc&ft:locale=en-US","line":88},{"title":"Simplified process for 3DES deprecation","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=check-3des&family=washingtondc&ft:locale=en-US","line":92},{"title":"Property-driven multi-layer caller inspection for Code Signing","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=code-sign-properties&family=washingtondc&ft:locale=en-US","line":96},{"title":"Switch between ServiceNow Root of Trust \\(ROT\\) and your own ROT","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=change-rot-overview&family=washingtondc&ft:locale=en-US","line":100},{"title":"New plugin available for Code Signing roles and administrative features","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=cs-role-landing&family=xanadu&ft:locale=en-US","line":111},{"title":"Column Level Encryption is now Field Encryption","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=column-level-encryption-landing&family=yokohama&ft:locale=en-US","line":122},{"title":"Access observer","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=access-observer&family=yokohama&ft:locale=en-US","line":126},{"title":"Improved migration process from Edge Encryption to Field Encryption","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=column-level-encryption-landing&family=yokohama&ft:locale=en-US","line":130},{"title":"Keep track of Field Encryption and Key Management changes","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=c_UnderstandingTheSysAuditTable&family=zurich&ft:locale=en-US","line":141},{"title":"Review","target":"https: